doctype html
html
  head
    title Welcome to MetGo
  body
    header(style='background-color: #0279b1; padding: 15px; text-align: center;')
      img(src='https://pacecode.com.np/image/assets/logo_w.png', alt='MetGo Logo', style='max-width: 100%; height: 30px; width:30px')
      h1(style='margin-top: 10px; color: #fff;') Welcome to MetGo

    main
      section
        p
          | Dear #{guestName},
        p
          | We are thrilled to welcome you to MetGo, your trusted partner in destination management. Whether you're here for business or leisure, we are committed to ensuring your stay is memorable and stress-free.
        p
          | Our team is dedicated to providing exceptional service, personalized experiences, and local insights to make your visit truly special.

      section
        h2 Contact Information
        p
          | If you need any assistance during your stay, feel free to contact us:
        ul
          li Email: info@metgo.app
          li Phone: +977-9863025214

      section
        p
          | Thank you for choosing MetGo. We wish you a fantastic stay and look forward to exceeding your expectations.

    footer(style='background-color: #0279b1; color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 10px;')
      p
        | © #{new Date().getFullYear()} MetGo. All rights reserved.
